                                <span class="pz-aviso-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 8a6 6 0 0 1 12 0c0 5 2 6 2 6H4s2-1 2-6"/><path d="M10.5 21a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 3 0"/></svg></span>
